# Thousand Needles - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 7 confirmed flagged rares of Thousand
# Needles and its fixed Solid Chests. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the
# end of the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that
# is not up never holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the local
# Forever game data (questie-forever); signature drops are items whose SOLE
# dropper is the rare. Two rares above the 25-35 band ship with honest
# come-back notes (sole signatures argue for them); no flagged rare is
# excluded. Single-point rares get plain single-goto steps (a loop needs at
# least two); the one multi-point rare loops all 3. No tame lines ship
# (the data has no tameability flag and the core guide carries no tame
# corroboration — see docs/companion-unverified.md). Respawn timers are
# unconfirmed anywhere, so none are stated. No shipped rare is a giver,
# ender, or objective of any core-contracted quest; where a shipped rare
# also drops a core quest item the note says so and points at the core
# guide.
guide butler-routes-completionist/thousand-needles-rares
title Thousand Needles - Rares & Treasures
levels 25-35
zone Thousand Needles
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords thousand needles, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Heartrazor — the west

  zone map 1441

  goto 16.75,41.49
  kill 5934 optional
  collect 285190 "Wyvern Heart Band" optional
  note Level 32 rare at its single confirmed point in the west; its sole drop is the Wyvern Heart Band. No quest takes it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

