step Solid Chests — the west, north and flats

  zone map 1441

  loop
  goto 13.94,38.82
  goto 17.63,41.79
  goto 17.84,21.29
  goto 18.56,20.90
  goto 18.92,23.23
  goto 19.36,21.74
  goto 26.58,54.02
  goto 27.18,52.55
  goto 42.21,31.70
  goto 42.24,37.39
  goto 42.94,39.31
  goto 43.02,36.81
  goto 43.45,33.28
  goto 44.91,32.27
  goto 65.25,87.00
  goto 68.47,82.95
  goto 69.69,85.84
  goto 71.20,85.19
  interact 2852 optional
  interact 2855 optional
  note Two generic Solid Chest objects share the zone, 2852 at fourteen points in the west, north and east-center and 2855 at four points on the Shimmering Flats; loot is the usual chest fare. No quest takes either.
  note Respawn timers unconfirmed.

step Silithid Ravager — Shimmering Flats east (come back later)

  zone map 1441

  loop
  goto 67.26,86.10
  goto 68.38,82.32
  goto 70.03,86.22
  kill 4132 optional
  collect 8224 "Silithid Ripper" optional
  note Level 37 rare working its 3 confirmed points on the eastern Flats; its sole drop is the Silithid Ripper. No quest takes it. Come back at high level - two over the guide band.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Vile Sting — the east

  zone map 1441

  goto 70.55,72.92
  kill 5937 optional
  collect 285177 "Nature's Sting Legguards" optional
  note Level 35 rare at its single confirmed point in the east; its sole drop is the Nature's Sting Legguards. It also drops Salty Scorpid Venom, which the core guide's Salt Flat Venom chain already routes alongside two common scorpid droppers — this guide only points at the rare.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Ironeye the Invincible — the far east (come back later)

