  kill 5935 optional
  collect 8223 "Blade of the Basilisk" optional
  note Level 37 rare at its single confirmed point in the far east; its sole drop is the Blade of the Basilisk. No quest takes it. Come back at high level - two over the guide band.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.
